      "text": {
        "en": "Clients speak enthusiastically about vets like Beth, Natasha, and Anita, as well as the attentive nursing team in Blackheath Village. Pet owners emphasize that clinicians take time for thorough consultations and explain findings clearly without rushing. Handlers appreciate the genuine warmth and compassion shown to pets and their owners."
