      "title": {
        "en": "Low-stress care and treats for pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight how effectively the staff eases anxiety for nervous cats and dogs through gentle handling and abundant treats. Several reviewers note that dogs normally fearful of vet visits happily explore the consultation rooms and receive injections calmly. Owners value seeing their animals relaxed and eager during appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Calm and modern clinic environment"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers repeatedly praise the clinic design, describing it as spacious, spotless, and reminiscent of a calming retreat rather than a traditional clinic. Visitors appreciate practical touches such as a dedicated treat wall, complimentary coffee, and comfortable waiting spaces. The relaxed setting helps reduce stress for visiting animals."
      }
    }
